WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I can only hope
that some of the journalists

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.471 size:78% position:39%
who are so upset that
Michelle made fun of

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sarah Sanders'
eye shadow will set aside

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.374 line:92%
a little of their outrage

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
for this other thing
that happened on Saturday.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:14.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here to comment, Jenny Hagel.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thanks, Seth.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump held a rally
in Michigan this weekend,

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.087
and, at one point, he asked the
crowd the following question.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:24.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Any Hispanics in the room?
Hispanic?

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:27.660 line:92%
Eh, not so many. That's okay.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm Hispanic and
I think I speak for all of us

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.968 line:92%
when I say, "Ay dios mío."

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.436 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That clip is terrifying.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump asked if there were any
Hispanics in the room.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.374 line:92%
Nothing good starts like that.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:44.677
If you look around the room
and say, "Is Becca here?",

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.378 size:81% position:41% line:92%
the next thing you say

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
isn't going to be something
nice about Becca.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're Hispanic
and a person at a podium asks,

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Are there any
Hispanics in the room?",

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's your cue
to get out of that room.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's your cue
to pull a Von Trapp.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:03.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The Von Trapp family singers.
[ Applause ]

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:10.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
And for the record,
you don't have to ask

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:15.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
if there are any Hispanics
at a Trump rally.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.476 line:92%
Of course we're not there.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:19.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'd literally rather
do anything else.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'd rather eat food
seasoned by white people.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:26.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'd rather talk
in a quiet voice

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:29.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
at a normal speed
without using our hands.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.192 size:78% position:39%
We'd rather listen to
a non-Spanish speaker

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.428
pronounce the name of the
guy who directed "The Revenant."

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:40.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
I dare you.
Seth, you want to try?

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.202 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Um...

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:42.602 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
no.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:47.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'll give you $100
right now to roll an "R."

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:50.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ru...

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:54.214 line:92%
-That was r-r-r-r-ridiculous.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.649
People wasted a lot of time
this weekend getting mad

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:57.517 size:88% position:44% line:92%
about an eye-shadow joke

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.452 size:81% position:41%
and ignoring something
much more important --

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:04.157
that is a scary time to be a
minority in America right now.

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.792 size:84% position:42%
My mom is Puerto Rican,
which means she's been

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
an American citizen
her entire life,

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:09.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
but she has started
carrying a copy of

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:12.365 size:78% position:39%
her birth certificate
around in her wallet.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:13.366 size:75% position:38% line:92%
That's terrifying...

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:16.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
mostly for whoever pulls her
over and asks to see it,

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:21.241
because God help the person who
goes toe-to-toe with my mom.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.309 size:84% position:42%
Trump has a history of
talking about Hispanics

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.411 size:75% position:38%
like we're something
other than American.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
But Hispanic-Americans
are Americans.

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:30.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
We contribute to
this country every day

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.152 line:92%
in real and concrete ways.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:34.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't take
the best we have to offer

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:35.989 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and then cast us aside.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
And by "the best
we have to offer,"

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:42.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am referring, of course,
to avocado toast.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:46.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're welcome.
That will be $17, please.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.569 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump's anti-Hispanic rhetoric
is scary and real,

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's happening
in our country right now.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
You should care about it
if you're Hispanic

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you should care
about it if you're not,

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:04.284 line:92%
because if they come for us now,

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:09.455
you know what they're coming for
next -- your avocado toast.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Seth?

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:12.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Give it up for Jenny,
everybody!

